{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Paths", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Generation Gap", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Some people have been taught that <span class=\"italic\">will</span> is <span class=\"italic\">the future</span> in English. This is not entirely correct. Sometimes when we talk about the future we cannot use <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We can use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to talk about future events we believe to be certain.<br><br>We use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> when we want to talk about a plan for the future.<br><br>We use the <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> when the action takes place at a definite point in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Maybe I'll take a class next semester. <br/>I think he'll be okay.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to go to a movie this weekend. <br/>His parents are going to be upset for a while. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm leaving for Europe on Monday. <br/>I'm interviewing for a job at 2 p.m. tomorrow.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Personal Qualities and Behavior", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about family, you often describe their personalities and their behavior.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Personality is a person's general character (the way they are). <br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat. </span> <Br><br>Behavior is the way people  act or conduct themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed but today he seems nervous.</span> <br><br> We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conservative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traditional; unprogressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stubborn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inflexible; single-minded\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"energetic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"active; lively\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ambitious\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"determined; eager\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"adventurous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bold; daring\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"enthusiastic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"keen; passionate\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Nick is stubborn like his father.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Uncle Edward is very conservative. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My sister is always energetic.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I am the most ambitious person in my family.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to move out of the house", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to leave the family home", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My nephew is moving out of the house this month.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about family matters.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to see eye to eye", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to agree on different issues", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ted and his father don't see eye to eye. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "generation gap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the difference in the way the young and old see things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is definitely a generation gap between Ted and his father. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "adventurous ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "willing to take risks ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's extremely adventurous. He'll go anywhere and try anything. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "conservative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traditional ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Both of her parents are very conservative. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "stubborn", "type": "name"}, {"content": "determined not to change your mind ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are both stubborn and will not change their thinking. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enthusiastic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being eager and excited ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's enthusiastic about his new job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "energetic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "active; lively ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are both highly energetic and do all types of activities. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Cut up index cards into 4 equal parts.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the 6 behavior and personality words from the lesson, one on each card.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "On the back write a short sentence explaining the word using synonyms. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look up 10 more behavior and personality words. Complete more cards with those words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Bring them to class and try your words with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Draw 2 cards, review the words, then think of a family member, friend or famous person who has those qualities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find 10 behavior and personality words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I find synonyms for them in a thesaurus.", "type": "text"