els in the city. He's coming in next week to see what he can find.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn6le01ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Will he be happy to start at the bottom? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think so. He's energetic and ambitious. I'm sure he'll work hard. I think he'll do fine.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How will his parents feel?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:They're going to be upset for a while. I'm sad they're arguing.<br>", "id": 3, "time": "43000", "image": "engenn6le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le01ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}